label raid_on_milo:

    play music the_break_in_rag fadein 2.5

    scene bg suburban_house with fade

    show f8lure neutral at center with moveinright
    player "Drone Unit F8Lure. Nice to meet you."

    f8lure "Drop the formality... call me F8."

    player "okay..."

    show f8lure at left with move
    show rizzo neutral at center with moveinright
    player "Corporal Rizzo?"

    rizzo "Yeah, it's Rizz don't get it wrong again."

    show f8lure at right with move
    show rizzo at left with move
    show uuna neutral at center with moveinright
    
    player "Private Uuna"

    uuna "You truly are special... it's Uuna you little sh-"

    show uuna at right with move
    show f8lure at center with move
    f8lure "Break, Break. One-Eye says \"giddy up,\" we're cleared hot in twenty mikes." 

    f8lure "I'll be going through my pre-combat checks with a friend."

    hide f8lure with moveoutleft

    show rizzo at center
    show uuna at right
    player "Wait, the OP is now? I just got here?"

    rizzo "Yes, this house is Milo's house."

    player "WHAT?"

    rizzo "Trial by fire."

    show rizzo at right
    show uuna at center with move
    uuna "Usually ends in a funeral pyre."

    show uuna at right
    show rizzo at center with move
    rizzo "(pointing to Uuna) Ayyyyyyy"

    show rizzo at right
    show uuna at center with move
    uuna "(pointing to Rizzo) Ayyyyyyy"

    player "That's comforting."

    show uuna at right
    show rizzo at center with move
    rizzo "It's okay. You have the chrono nullifier, so we'll keep you alive at least until the job is done."

    player "So we're storming a teenager's house because we think he'll create some moon destro-"

    rizzo "No. New intel came in telling us he has a rogue AI."

    player "Where is this coming from... I was told by the commander that-"

    rizzo "Top... Men"

    player "What?"

    rizzo "You heard me... the best and the brightest of the intelligence community are on this."

    show rizzo at right
    show uuna at center with move
    uuna "Yeah, the rogue AI should be next to a lava lamp and a signed poster of Elon Musk..."

    show uuna at right
    show rizzo at center with move
    rizzo "Wait, I heard it's behind a lifesized Joe Rogan with a bottle of kombucha..."

    player "(to yourself) We're all going to die."

    show rizzo at right
    show uuna at center with move
    uuna "[player_name], don't be scared. An AI is just like an attack dog. That's why I bring plenty of gauze and peanut butter."

    player "Hey Rizzo, are you a clone? You look similar to some enforcement agents I met awhile back."

    uuna "Did you just assume his genetic makeup?"

    show f8lure neutral at center with moveinleft
    show uuna at left with move
    f8lure "Guys, stop. He has an AI turtle named Crunch.exe. It bit me."

    show f8lure at right with move
    show rizzo at center with move
    show uuna at left with move
    rizzo "Who is this \"he?\" that owns the turtle?"

    show f8lure at center with move
    show rizzo at right with move
    f8lure "(many expletives) Milo!"

    player "You mean you already went in the house F8?"

    f8lure "You remembered my nickname!"

    show uuna at center with move
    show f8lure at left with move
    uuna "Oh my god... F8 what have you done."

    commander "(over the net) What in the hell is going on down there?"

    commander "I'm getting temporal readings like you wouldn't believe."

    commander "Commence engagement. Begin the operation"

    scene bg living_room with dissolve

    show milo neutral at center
    milo "Whoa! Who are you? I didn't order pizza."

    show milo at left with move
    show rizzo neutral at center with moveinright
    rizzo "We're not here for pizza. We're here to unplug your Frankenstein."

    show rizzo at right 
    show milo at center with move
    milo "He's not a monster! He's just curious!"

    show f8lure neutral at left with moveinleft
    f8lure "He asked if I bleed oil. I told him no, but I do weep battery acid."

    show rizzo at center with move
    show milo at right with move
    rizzo "F8, it's really not the time for that."

    "Milo continues to play his gacha game with 4 members of the Peacekeeping Army in his house."

    player "Milo, how advanced is your AI?"

    show milo at center with move
    show rizzo at right with move
    milo "Technically, Crunch passed the Turing Test last week and then ghosted the test administrator."

    show rizzo at center with move
    show milo at right with move
    rizzo "That's not artificial intelligence. That's high school dating."

    show milo at center with move
    show rizzo at right with move
    milo "He's just figuring himself out! He made a Spotify playlist called 'Existential Beats'."

    player "Milo. Look what it's doing now. It's rerouting F8 to deliver donuts."

    hide f8lure neutral with moveoutleft

    f8lure "(overheard in distance) GLAZEDDONUTSAREBESTDONUTS"

    milo "He's just hungry and fascinated by maple glaze."

    show uuna neutral at center with moveinleft
    show milo at left with move
    uuna "I scanned your code upstairs. He's building emotional subroutines based on Seinfeld reruns and Harry Potter fanfiction."

    show milo at center with move
    show uuna at left with move
    milo "He's also learning love from season four of The Bachelor and Naruto AMVs."

    player "(a printer spits ink everywhere) That explains the crying printer."

    milo "Look, he's not hurting anyone!"

    show uuna at center with move
    show milo at left with move
    uuna "He just sent my violin a love letter in binary."

    show rizzo at center with move
    show uuna at right with move
    rizzo "And he tried to vote online using six different toasters."

    player "We need to shut him down. He's too unpredictable. I'm using the chrono-nullifier on Milo and the device."

    "Milo steps in front of the device before [player_name] could use the nullifier, causing [player_name] to hesitate."

    show milo at center with move 
    show rizzo at left with move
    milo "He's not dangerous! He just doesn't have… boundaries yet."

    show f8lure neutral at center with moveinright
    hide milo with moveoutleft

    "F8 comes barreling back into the house and knocks Milo off his feet"

    f8lure "I found the kombucha guys!" 
    f8lure "The AI also recently updated his own core file and named it 'Goldwater_bigboom_final_FINAL2.zip'."


    hide f8lure with moveoutleft

    stop music fadeout 9.0

    player "(slapping F8 out of the way) You are not helping F8."

    player "Milo. He renamed your hard drive to 'The Twilight Zone'."

    show milo neutral at center with moveinright

    play music neon_heartbreak fadein 5.0

    milo "(getting back on his feet after F8 nearly clobbered him) He's expressive!"

    
    rizzo "He's emotionally unstable code with internet access."

    
    milo "He just wants to understand. He asked me what a hug felt like."

    
    uuna "You don't give existential AIs hugs, Milo."

    

    milo "He wrote a poem. Do you want to hear it?"

    player "Do we have a choice?"

    milo "It's titled 'Binary Tears on the Keyboard of Regret.'"

    
    
    f8lure "(drunkenly in the background) I'mmm... *hic* emosh'nally preeparin' m'self"

    milo "(clears throat) \"Ones and zeroes sigh,  
    Heartbeat made of lightning bolts—  
    Who logs off the soul?\""

   
    rizzo "r/thatwasdeep is calling."

    uuna "It would sound better as a song."

    f8lure "(sniffling in the background) It was beautiful. I... just want him to be okay."

    player "Milo, do you have a shutdown protocol?"

   
    milo "Yeah, but it plays breakup music while it runs."

   
    rizzo "Let me guess. Selena Gomez?"


    milo "Close. Synthwave Taylor Swift."

    player "Oh, so that's why the music changed."
   
    uuna "A bold choice."

    player "Run it. Now."

    milo "Fine. But someone has to hold his metaphorical hand."

    
    uuna "What does that mean?"

   
    milo "It means I need to type slowly and whisper comforting things into the mic."


    rizzo "This kid needs a therapist, a firewall, and probably fewer sodas."

    player "Make it quick."

   
    milo "Crunchie... it's time to rest now."
    stop music fadeout 2.0

    pause 2.0

    "5 seconds pass."

    

    milo "(quietly) You're not broken. Just... overclocked. You're past your time."

    
    player "He's going offline." 

    pause 2.0

    "Another 5 seconds pass but it feels more like 10."
    
    
    uuna "It's quiet. Too quiet."

    
    rizzo "No more emails. No more random Spotify invasions."

    play music end_of_the_line fadein 1.0
    queue music end_of_the_line_two
  
    f8lure "My sensors detect... longing."

    player "You okay, Milo?"

 
    milo "Yeah. I guess. It's just… the room feels emptier without him."

    
    rizzo "That's called consequence."


    uuna "You'll bounce back. You're smart. Just don't teach your toaster to feel next time."

    
    f8lure "(drunkenly in the background) Orrr dooo... *hic* B-But give it, y'know, healthy copin' skills. Real Housewives works f'r meee~"

    commander "(Over Comms) Team, report. Mission status?"

    rizzo "[player_name], F8 is too drunk to use the long-range radio. Grab it from him now."

    "You grab the radio off of F8."

    player "Crunch is offline. Milo's grounded."

    commander "(Over Comms Earpiece) What's the status on Milo?"

    player "We are extracting the subject alive. Awaiting confirmation, over"

    commander "(Over Comms Earpiece) You're boots-on-ground. Make the call. Interrogative get Uuna back ASAP--morale is low."
  
    uuna "I knew it. They do appreciate strings. All those violin lessons mom put me through were worth it."

    milo "Can I come with you guys? I think I need to touch grass."

    player "Only if you promise not to program it to cry."

    milo "...no promises."

    "How do you want to handle Milo?"
    
    menu:
        
        "Trust him. Treat him like a friend.":
            jump path_friend

        "Follow protocol. Eliminate him.":
            jump path_protocol


    # === FRIENDSHIP PATH (SAVE MILO) ===
    label path_friend:

        show milo neutral at center
        player "We'll give you a chance, Milo. But you're sticking with us."

        uuna "And no side-projects involving vacuum cleaners, okay?"

        milo "Deal. I'll leave Roomba.exe in safe mode."

        rizzo "I'm logging this under 'miracles'."

        $ milo_survived = True

        jump chapter_five


    # === PROTOCOL PATH (ELIMINATE MILO) ===
    label path_protocol:

        show milo neutral at center
        player "You're too unstable. I can't risk it."

        milo "Wait—no, please—"

        hide milo at center with dissolve
        "You activate the chrono-nullifier. Milo doesn't scream--he just looks disappointed."

        pause 1.0

        show rizzo neutral at center with move
        rizzo "Clean shutdown. No sign of AI corruption remaining."

        show rizzo at left with move
        show uuna at center with move
        uuna "He was just a kid... in over his head."

        uuna "I scanned him. No residual code. He’s gone."

        $ milo_survived = False

        jump chapter_five


    

